Cell["\<\
~/src/plantri52/plantri -p -s 13 Polyhedral_13.s6
96262938 polytopes written to Polyhedral_13.s6; cpu=199.83 sec\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e4434113-951c-43d7-9afc-3acff13cb835"],

